      drift   mean corr      min      max   frac>0
  ------------------------------------------------
       deg1      0.4535   0.2623   0.7061   100.0%
     deg1+2      0.1170  -0.2128   0.3877    75.0%

  A rise in mean corr(P,-E) is the oracle improving. enh_true overtaking
  enh_deg1 on the blocks marked 'n' is the walk changing what it aims at -
  which is the claim T7 could not see, because final energy is downstream
  of the decode and the decode averages the concentration away.
